\tag{fnip}
\title{The Hodgkin–Huxley equations}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{The [membrane equation](fnip-0066) lets a conductance depend on
the voltage and on further variables. The sodium and potassium
conductances change because those variables change.}

\p{How do the sodium and potassium conductances depend on the
voltage, and which equations do the voltage and those variables
satisfy?}

